# Only ship API source and migration files. Never send local credentials, databases,
# virtual environments, recordings, or unrelated inference containers to the builder.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!alembic.ini
!docker-entrypoint.sh
!app/
!app/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
